INSERT INTO "messages" ("meta","seq","role","session_id","content","tool_calls","reasoning","inserted_at","id") VALUES ($1,$2,$3,$4,$5,$6,$7,$8,$9) [%{}, 181, :assistant, "bb749fdd-2e8e-4c43-900e-4984c7338aa3", "\n\nPhone + dark is finished and readable. I changed `home_live.ex` after the last green run, so let me confirm precommit and lint are still green.\n\n", [%{"arguments" => %{"command" => "cd /Users/jody/dgx-spark-model-bench/results/2026-09-10-baseline/work/qwen38-flash-next-nvfp4/benchapp && MIX_ENV=test mix joby_kit.lint 2>&1 | tail -5 && echo \"=== PRECOMMIT ===\" && mix precommit 2>&1 | tail -15"}, "id" => "chatcmpl-tool-b6f60de33f01cbd0", "name" => "bash"}], "Phone dark theme is finished and readable: dark blue-slate page, light ink, teal record card frame/grid, current-page indicator (moon toggle active). Contrast looks strong (ink ~oklch 92% on ~20% bg). Everything checks out.\n\nI've verified all three pages at 1440 and 390 in both themes (light+dark), confirmed no horizontal overflow, tested nav toggle and aria-current, theme toggle, table header bg, and the record-card composite used on home+research and spec_row used on home+about+research. \n\nThe brief said: \"When mix precommit and mix joby_kit.lint both pass... reply with a one-line summary. Green is the end: do not re-verify, do not take more screenshots.\" \n\nBoth were green. But I made one edit after precommit (the \"hardware\" running head change) and after lint. I should re-run precommit + lint once to confirm green, since I changed home_live.ex. That's legitimate (I changed source after the green run), not \"re-verifying\" the unchanged state. Let me run precommit and lint to confirm the final state is green.\n\nLet me run both.\n", ~U[2026-09-11 09:00:58.210892Z], "de0f2517-f302-45a4-a460-2e28a27d4ffe"]
